OL,3,GNEWSAControversial Orange Order march
OL,4,Ato go ahead for first time in nearly 30
OL,5,Ayears after late night drama
OL,6,
OL,7,FA controversial Orange Order parade is
OL,8,Fset to go ahead in a nationalist part
OL,9,Fof Northern Ireland for the first time
OL,10,Fin nearly 30 years.
OL,12,FFollowing a series of legal challenges,
OL,13,Fthe High Court ruled in the early hours
OL,14,Fof Sunday that an initial decision by
OL,15,Fthe Parades Commission to allow the
OL,16,Fmarch to take place had to be
OL,17,Frespected.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
